# ── Confidential: never publish ──────────────────────────────────────────
# These live in ../instructor-private/ and must not be copied back in here.
# The patterns are belt-and-braces: the real protection is that the files are
# outside this directory, and the pre-commit hook refuses anything carrying
# the "INSTRUCTOR ONLY" banner.
Instructor_Guide.*
Keys_and_Calibration.*
*_PAPER.*
Midterm_*
Final_*
*Gradebook*
*answer*key*
*marking*scheme*
*solutions*

# Anything a student must never see, by convention
**/private/**
**/instructor/**
*CONFIDENTIAL*
*INSTRUCTOR_ONLY*

# Real student data
*roster*
*attendance*
*Attendence*
*grades*
*marks*
*.csv.private

# ── Working files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*                 # Office lock files
*.tmp
*.bak
.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# Student submissions, if any ever land here
submissions/
grading/
